{"seq":8,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-mu-heldout/sc-05-hartford-postmortem/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T23:29:03.500Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"d16d0330b106a4b80414bdbe26104e727cdd9fccd742eab963861a6e87c48165","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","text":"Gideon Sato: your first report was at 10:42 AM (CDT) on 3 Aug, here in #inc-vtg-hartford. You said both inbound lanes at Vantorre's Hartford plant showed a white screen after badge scan. From the channel, the guard was writing trailer numbers on a clipboard while the kiosks were down. That's the only thing the channel says about him until the kiosks came back. At 11:03 Mateo posted that kiosk 1 was back and the guard had checked in trailer 8836, which dispatch could see. At 11:07 you reported both lanes working, in a message posted at 11:08. So the outage window is roughly 10:42 to 11:07. The channel doesn't say what the guard did beyond the clipboard.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
